   "status": "proposed",
   "one_line": "The person accepts, sends back with a comment or drops each changed piece, and may comment on, edit or remove words, in the page or on Catch up cards, where a swipe right accepts and any change is typed.",
   "doc": "software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-answer-pieces/feature.md",
