 "bi_8": {
  "lines_before": 30,
  "lines_after": 40,
  "added": [
   "- [Review what agents make (Argus)](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/capability.md) (capability) — adds",
   "- [Open a review on what a run changed, and keep every answer on the run's branch](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-open-review/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Read what a run made, as business intents with their ICE and as the product](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-read-outcome/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Answer each piece, in the page or one card at a time](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-answer-pieces/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Accept or send back each ADR that waits for a person](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-review-adrs/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [See what memory holds, and approve or reject each memory update that waits for a person](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-review-memory/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Check each agent decision against the memory it rested on](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-check-agent-decisions/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Send a piece back and get it reworked](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-send-back/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Finish the review and have every answer applied in one commit](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-apply-answers/feature.md) (feature) — adds",
   "- [Run Argus apart from Garura, and point Garura at it](../software-delivery-planning/review-agent-work/fn-run-tool-apart/feature.md) (feature) — adds"
  ],
